  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the Social Integration of Third-Country Nationals and Their Awareness, through Capacity-Building on Crisis Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to fostering migrants&#x2019; inclusion in host communities, by building their skills and enhancing their communication and collaboration with local stakeholders, in the area of fire protection response. The project targets migrants who are currently hosted in the reception and identification centres in the island of Samos and serves as a pilot intervention to test the effectiveness of the proposed activities. Beneficiaries are engaged in tailor-made language and vocational training, including a training-of-trainers component that seeks to foster the sustainability of the project and strengthen communication between the local authorities and the host community.</narrative>
  </description>
